From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adn Elkawass <elkawasadn@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 00:20:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] configs: th1520_lpi4a: enable AON remoteproc support

Enable the reset controller and remoteproc support required to load and
start firmware on the TH1520 E902 AON core.

Keep this board-specific rather than selecting the reset driver globally
for all TH1520 boards.

Upstream-Status: Pending [not submitted upstream]
Signed-off-by: Adn Elkawass <elkawasadn@gmail.com>
---

--- a/configs/th1520_lpi4a_defconfig
+++ b/configs/th1520_lpi4a_defconfig
@@ -108,3 +108,7 @@
 CONFIG_BZIP2=y
 CONFIG_ZSTD=y
 CONFIG_LIB_RATIONAL=y
+CONFIG_DM_RESET=y
+CONFIG_RESET_TH1520=y
+CONFIG_CMD_REMOTEPROC=y
+CONFIG_REMOTEPROC_THEAD_TH1520=y
